 tensors a phase needs are materialised: phase `kv` runs the frozen VLM (vision tower + connector first, freed, then
@@ -113,13 +116,15 @@ def vision_position_ids(size: int, patch: int = 16, image_size: int = 512) -> np
     side, n = image_size // patch, size // patch
     boundaries = torch.arange(1 / side, 1.0, 1 / side)
     idx = torch.arange(n, dtype=torch.float32)
-    frac = idx / n * (1 - 1e-6)
+    # transformers >= 5: fractional_coords = idx * (1 / n), clamped to 1 - 1e-6 (the earlier `idx / n * (1 - 1e-6)` puts
